            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "What Trump's Nvidia China sales approval means for the Mag 7",
            "description": "<p>President Trump <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/trump-approves-nvidia-h200-chips-for-sale-to-china-203937120.html\">announced on Monday</a> that he has approved Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) selling H200 chips in China.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/ines-ferre/\">Ines Ferr\u00e9</a>, Siebert Financial chief investment officer Mark Malek, and Principal Asset Management chief global strategist Seema Shah join Opening Bid host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> to discuss the impact on Nvidia, the artificial intelligence (AI) trade, and the \"Magnificent Seven.\"</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "President Trump announced on Monday that he has approved Nvidia (NVDA) selling H200 chips in China. Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter Ines Ferr\u00e9, Siebert Financial chief investment officer Mark Malek, and Principal Asset Management chief global strategist Seema Shah join Opening Bid host Brian Sozzi to discuss the impact on Nvidia, the artificial intelligence (AI) trade, and the \"Magnificent Seven.\" To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Opening Bid.",
