        {
          "id": "769be123-98b9-3a99-94db-993d4f20ed4c",
          "content": {
            "id": "769be123-98b9-3a99-94db-993d4f20ed4c",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "2026 will be a 'stronger year' for markets, strategist explains",
            "description": "<p>The Federal Reserve's December FOMC meeting will conclude on Wednesday, December 10, with investors expecting US central bank officials to vote on <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/the-fed-is-likely-to-cut-rates-for-a-third-time-this-year-what-happens-next-year-is-less-certain-110003305.html\">a hawkish interest rate cut</a> to end 2025. The decision announcement will be followed by a press conference with Fed Chair Jerome Powell.</p>\n<p>Principal Asset Management Chief Global Strategist Seema Shah and Siebert Financial CIO Mark Malek share their perspectives on what a rate cut will mean for the market's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>) Santa Claus Rally heading into 2026.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "The Federal Reserve's December FOMC meeting will conclude on Wednesday, December 10, with investors expecting US central bank officials to vote on a hawkish interest rate cut to end 2025. The decision announcement will be followed by a press conference with Fed Chair Jerome Powell. Principal Asset Management Chief Global Strategist Seema Shah and Siebert Financial CIO Mark Malek share their perspectives on what a rate cut will mean for the market's (^DJI, ^IXIC, ^GSPC) Santa Claus Rally heading into 2026. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Opening Bid.",
